      <title>🌯💙💚 Burritos for the Bulldogs! 💚💙🌯</title>
      <description>🌯💙💚 Burritos for the Bulldogs! 💚💙🌯

Skip the cooking Wednesday night and let Chipotle feed the family while you support Boles JH Athletics! 🐾

📅 Wednesday, October 14th
⏰ 5–9 PM
📍 Chipotle – 5320 Kennedale Sublett Rd, Kennedale

25% of event sales go straight to the Boles JH Athletic Booster Club to support our athletes! 🏈🏐🏀

How to make it count:
✅ Show the flyer (on your phone is fine!) in the restaurant
✅ Or order online for pickup with code XCZ7HWD

⚠️ Delivery orders and gift cards don't count — pickup or dine-in only!

Grab your crew, tell your friends, and let's fill that Chipotle with green and blue! 💚💙</description>
